      "heading": "I.3 · Colour, bitmap images",
      "sentence": "Colour is a relation — sampled, displayed, named, and interpreted — not a fixed swatch.",
      "prompt": "CONTENIDOS: Color, imágenes con mapas de bits",
      "quote": "The raster image fears the zoom. The SVG welcomes it.",
      "quote_origin": "tao_invented",
